@startuml seq-bootstrap
title US-81 — Create, configure, bootstrap and protect
actor Maintainer
participant "gh CLI" as GH
participant "GitHub API" as API
participant "scrapup/scrapup-ds" as Repo

== TF-81-01 Create and configure ==
Maintainer -> GH : gh repo create scrapup/scrapup-ds --public
GH -> API : POST /orgs/scrapup/repos
API --> GH : 201 created (empty)
Maintainer -> API : PATCH general + merge (mirror scrapup/scrapup)
Maintainer -> API : PUT workflow permissions (read, can create PRs)
Maintainer -> API : PUT actions allowlist (GitHub-owned + 2 patterns)
Maintainer -> API : PUT vulnerability-alerts, automated-security-fixes,\nprivate-vulnerability-reporting
Maintainer -> API : PATCH security_and_analysis\n(secret scanning + push protection)
API --> Maintainer : settings verified
== TF-81-02 Bootstrap commit ==
Maintainer -> Repo : git push main (governance, SECURITY.md, dependabot.yml,\nSHA-pinned workflows, specs)
alt contains a detectable secret
  Repo --> Maintainer : rejected by push protection
else clean
  Repo --> Maintainer : main created; release-please: no Release PR
end
== TF-81-03 Rulesets (step 1) ==
Maintainer -> API : POST rulesets main-review\n(1 code-owner approval; admin bypass at PR merge)
Maintainer -> API : POST rulesets main-integrity\n(validate + dependency-review; linear; no bypass)
Maintainer -> API : POST rulesets release-tags (v*: no update/delete)
alt direct push to main
  Maintainer -> Repo : git push main
  Repo --> Maintainer : rejected
else manual tag v*
  Maintainer -> Repo : git push tag v0.0.0-probe
  Repo --> Maintainer : rejected
else PR with invalid title
  Maintainer -> Repo : open PR "update stuff"
  Repo --> Maintainer : validate = failure, merge blocked
else admin PR, checks green
  Maintainer -> Repo : open PR "chore: probe repository gates"
  Repo --> Maintainer : review required; only admin bypass offered
end
@enduml
